1
00:00:00,058 --> 00:00:01,098
(Leonard:)Leslie Winkle.

2
00:00:01,268 --> 00:00:03,768
(Leslie:)Yeah, Leslie Winkle.
The answer to the question:

3
00:00:03,937 --> 00:00:06,687
"Who made Sheldon Cooper cry
like a little girl?"

4
00:00:07,566 --> 00:00:11,776
Yes, well, I'm polymerized tree sap,
and you're an inorganic adhesive.

5
00:00:11,945 --> 00:00:15,745
(Sheldon:)So whatever verbal projectile you launch
in my direction is reflected off of me...

6
00:00:15,908 --> 00:00:19,158
(Sheldon:)...returns on its original trajectory,
and adheres to you.

7
00:00:19,995 --> 00:00:22,125
(Leslie:)Oh, ouch.

8
00:00:22,581 --> 00:00:25,251
(Dr Gablehouser:)Okay, if everyone could please
take your seats?

9
00:00:33,217 --> 00:00:35,137
Here's your T-shirt.

10
00:00:38,138 --> 00:00:39,558
(Leslie:)PMS?

11
00:00:39,723 --> 00:00:41,813
It's a couple days early.

12
00:00:41,975 --> 00:00:43,515
(Leonard:)No.

13
00:00:43,685 --> 00:00:46,395
(Leonard:)It stands for Perpetual Motion Squad.

14
00:00:46,563 --> 00:00:48,563
(Leslie:)Oh, right, of course.
What was I thinking?

15
00:00:50,400 --> 00:00:56,020
(Gablehouser:)Good afternoon, everyone,
and welcome to this year's Physics Bowl.

